Subject: [PATCH] session-004b: PassiveScanner deduplication (24h window, per
 host+title)

- passive_scanner.py v0.2.0
  _dedup() filters findings by (title, host) within DEDUP_WINDOW_SECONDS (86400)
  flush_dedup_cache() for testing/manual resets
  healthcheck() now reports active dedup key count
- tests: 5 new dedup tests (suppress, different hosts, window expiry, flush, zero window)
---
 proxy/modules/passive_scanner.py | 116 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 tests/test_passive_scanner.py    |  83 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

